1
00:00:00,136 --> 00:00:01,566
Oh, me!
Yeah, me, too!

2
00:00:01,570 --> 00:00:03,640
(Mrs Cooper:)Coming up.

3
00:00:03,639 --> 00:00:06,809
(Leonard:)I don't really
feel I deserve it.

4
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,317
(Howard:)That was a big
sticky mess,

5
00:00:11,314 --> 00:00:13,084
(Howard:)but... I think I got it.

6
00:00:13,082 --> 00:00:14,152
(Raj:)Looks good.
Yeah.

7
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,050
(Penny:)Look at that.

8
00:00:16,052 --> 00:00:17,882
(Bernadette:)You cleaned it up
all by yourself.

9
00:00:17,887 --> 00:00:21,087
(Howard:)Yes, I cleaned it up
all by myself.

10
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,890
(Howard:)Honestly, I don't know
why you complain so...

11
00:00:24,759 --> 00:00:26,229
(Howard:)Okay, maybe I missed one spot.

12
00:00:32,834 --> 00:00:34,864
(Howard:)Just leave.

13
00:00:37,973 --> 00:00:39,443
(Mrs Cooper:)I'm so glad
that you and I were able

14
00:00:39,442 --> 00:00:41,472
(Mrs Cooper:)to bury the hatchet.
Me, too.

15
00:00:41,477 --> 00:00:43,807
(Dr Hofstadter:)And I respect your right
to your beliefs.

16
00:00:43,813 --> 00:00:45,983
(Mrs Cooper:)And I will
pray for you.

17
00:00:48,016 --> 00:00:50,416
(Leonard:)Okay, Mom, let's get you
back to your hotel

18
00:00:50,419 --> 00:00:51,849
(Leonard:)before anyone says
anything else.

19
00:00:51,854 --> 00:00:53,184
BEVERLY:
One moment.

20
00:00:53,189 --> 00:00:55,959
(Dr Hofstadter:)There's something
I need to say to you.

21
00:00:55,958 --> 00:00:58,688
(Leonard:)Oh, really? That's too bad.

